Align the package with the cookieplone-templates boilerplate: packaging moves from `setup.py` to `pyproject.toml` (hatchling), development uses `make` with uv and mxdev instead of tox, plone/meta and pre-commit are gone, the code is formatted and linted with ruff, and README, CHANGES and LICENSE are now Markdown (`CHANGELOG.md`). The tests move to a top-level `tests/` package run by pytest, and Playwright replaces Cypress and Robot Framework for the acceptance tests. Test code that imported `ROBOT_TESTING` or `E2E_TESTING` from `collective.taxonomy.testing` should use `ACCEPTANCE_TESTING`. @ericof
